Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Tasks Always Show Changed Status

Problem: Tasks appear to make changes on every run Solution:

    Use appropriate modules instead of shell/command
    Implement proper conditionals with when clauses
    Use creates parameter for command/shell modules when necessary

Issue 2: File Permissions or Ownership Issues

Problem: File tasks always show changes due to permission differences Solution:

- name: Ensure file with correct permissions
  file:
    path: /path/to/file
    state: touch
    mode: '0644'
    owner: root
    group: root

Issue 3: Service Restart Loops

Problem: Services restart unnecessarily Solution: Use handlers and proper service state management:

- name: Configure service
  template:
    src: config.j2
    dest: /etc/service/config
  notify: restart service

handlers:
  - name: restart service
    systemd:
      name: myservice
      state: restarted

